# Hanging hive (#365, D90), native 24x32 frames: rest (a paper wasp hive hanging by a stalk from a bough drawn in the
# top 5 rows), shake1, shake2 (the D7 warning; shake2 shows stinger tips), release (the curtain), bare (the bough after a knock-down), falling (the knocked hive alone), fallen (split on the floor).
